+The work directory must not exist. The test creates its own disk, formats
+LUKS2 and BFS, writes a source file, and unmounts/remounts to discard cached
+pages. Sixteen threads then read the decrypted device into separate private
+mappings of that file. Faulting while holding one of the driver's four
+bounce buffers deadlocked the old driver; all sixteen reads must finish
+with the fixed driver. `serial.log` records the result; the runner stops
+the VM on success, failure or timeout (180 seconds by default). The emulated
+network is restricted and keeps stock Haiku's network-unload deadlock out
+of this test.
